                                        "entry_id": "ffdc3a74-30fc-3bae-99c8-486e5c48363a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Diatomaceous earth, a kind of soft rock containing the remains of diatoms; it absorbs nitroglycerine and is used to manufacture dynamite."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
