                                                "sense_id": "9e9d53dd-f255-3e17-8de5-24681e2c8f45",
                                                "text": "It was the only name anybody seemed to know him by, “Kieselguhr” being a kind of fine clay, used to soak up nitroglycerine and stabilize it into dynamite."
                                            }
                                        ]
